MD</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chung</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiarie</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Lehman</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Overbaugh</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>John-Stewart</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Breast milk HIV-1 suppression and decreased transmission: a randomized trial comparing HIVNET 012 nevirapine versus short-course zidovudine</article-title><source>AIDS</source><year>2005</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>1415</fpage><lpage>1422</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'AIDS||19|1415||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16103773</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cote</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Biggar</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenberg</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Devesa</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Percy</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Yellin</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lemp</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Hardy</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Goedert</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Blattner</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Non-Hodgkin's lymphoma among people with AIDS: incidence, presentation and public health burden. AIDS&#x0002f;Cancer Study Group</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1997</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>645</fpage><lpage>650</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J